#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:5
#: d97e6d0f9900496082a0cac1a1967916
msgid "Tuning Navigation"
msgstr "导航调参"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:7
#: 68219e55a47e47ceaac30eca1cf8f29d
msgid ""
"This page describes how to tune the Navigation control including the \"L1 "
"controller\".  The lower level :ref:`speed <rover-tuning-throttle-and-"
"speed>` and :ref:`turn rate <rover-tuning-steering-rate>` controllers should"
" be tuned before attempting to tune this controller."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍如何调整导航控制器，包括「L1 控制器」。在尝试调整此控制器之前，应先调整底层的 :ref:`速度 <rover-tuning-"
"throttle-and-speed>` 和 :ref:`转向速率 <rover-tuning-steering-rate>` 控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:13
#: 74a5ffa498e34b6a99f99bf7d1497e35
msgid "L1 controller"
msgstr "L1 控制器"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:15
#: 397380a235b74f9581d25a54a6a1b991
msgid ""
"The L1 one controller is the highest level steering controller.  It accepts "
"position targets (i.e. latitude, longitude points) and the vehicle's current"
" speed and outputs a desired lateral acceleration which is then fed into "
"lower level controllers (including the Steering Rate controller).  Together "
"this leads to the vehicle tracking a line towards the target.  This "
"controller is used in all the autonomous modes including :ref:`Auto <auto-"
"mode>`, :ref:`Guided <guided-mode>`, :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` and "
":ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>`."
msgstr ""
"L1 "
"控制器是最高层级的转向控制器。它接收位置目标（即经纬度坐标点）及车辆当前速度，输出期望的横向加速度，再传递给底层控制器（包括转向速率控制器），从而使车辆沿路径追踪目标点。此控制器用于所有自主模式，包括"
" :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>`、:ref:`Guided <guided-mode>`、:ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` 和"
" :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:17
#: 5e39bf65a8b646c39f9127b7a82d18d5
msgid "Recommended steps for tuning the L1 controller:"
msgstr "调整 L1 控制器的建议步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:19
#: e6fb46acbbc643349760c7182d2b4479
msgid "Connect the ground station to the vehicle using a telemetry radio"
msgstr "通过数传电台将地面站与车辆连接"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:20
#: bc8d1d4236fa41b69616fc77b3fa9995
msgid ""
"Create an rectangular or back-and-forth mission (perhaps using the Mission "
"Planner's Flight Plan screen) and upload to the vehicle"
msgstr "创建矩形或来回往返任务（可使用 Mission Planner 的 Flight Plan 界面），并上传到车辆"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:21
#: fc2224a976a04789b54be18ca7a9dace
msgid ""
"Arm the vehicle (in :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>` or :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>`) "
"and switch to :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>` mode."
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>` 或 :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>` 下解锁车辆，然后切换到 "
":ref:`Auto <auto-mode>` 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:22
#: 1cfdd995e80c45e5a46fef282894aeb5
msgid ""
"If the rover weaves along the straights, then raise :ref:`NAVL1_PERIOD "
"<NAVL1_PERIOD>` (aka \"Lat Acc Cntrl Period\") in increments of 0.5"
msgstr ""
"若 Rover 在直线段蛇形行驶，请以 0.5 为步进增大 :ref:`NAVL1_PERIOD <NAVL1_PERIOD>` （即「Lat Acc "
"Cntrl Period」）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:23
#: 2ea4194e3f9f48a6b06f26d4f0a85ef7
msgid ""
"If the rover does not turn sharply enough then lower :ref:`NAVL1_PERIOD "
"<NAVL1_PERIOD>` (aka \"Lat Acc Cntrl Period\") in increments of 0.5"
msgstr ""
"若 Rover 转弯不够急，请以 0.5 为步进减小 :ref:`NAVL1_PERIOD <NAVL1_PERIOD>` （即「Lat Acc "
"Cntrl Period」）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:24
#: d6b130ee23a54d369bc249c23153bf33
msgid ""
"Raise :ref:`NAVL1_DAMPING <NAVL1_DAMPING>` (aka \"Lat Acc Cntrl Damp\") by "
"increments of 0.05 to improve navigation in tight courses"
msgstr ""
"以 0.05 为步进增大 :ref:`NAVL1_DAMPING <NAVL1_DAMPING>` （即「Lat Acc Cntrl "
"Damp」）以改善紧密航线中的导航效果"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:30
#: a772a48a8781489eb70615fa0d0ca472
msgid "Other Parameters"
msgstr "其他参数"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:32
#: 19a2e1ca51784025ac3353ecf6fedf2f
msgid ""
":ref:`ATC_TURN_MAX_G <ATC_TURN_MAX_G>` defines the maximum lateral "
"acceleration (in Gs = 9.81m/s/s) the controllers will attempt during "
"cornering.  Most vehicles cannot achieve more than 0.3G.  To more precisely "
"measure the vehicle's maximum possible lateral acceleration:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ATC_TURN_MAX_G <ATC_TURN_MAX_G>` 定义控制器在转弯时尝试达到的最大横向加速度（单位：G，即 "
"9.81m/s/s）。大多数车辆无法超过 0.3G。更精确地测量车辆最大可能横向加速度的方法："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:34
#: e8b5028739c54ec39d460db8afe9d571
msgid ""
"On Mission Planner's Flight Data screen, check the \"Tuning\" checkbox "
"(bottom middle), double click on the graph and select \"ay\" (Acceleration "
"Y-axis)"
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 的 Flight Data 界面，勾选「Tuning」复选框（底部中间），双击图表并选择「ay」（Y 轴加速度）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:35
#: 6b80ae1f861c4a64a0c4be05a6c46fdf
msgid ""
"Drive the vehicle in Manual mode at a high speed making very sharp turns"
msgstr "在 Manual 模式下高速驾驶车辆进行急转弯"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:36
#: 70de138adebd43e09d54ff9542d96672
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`ATC_TURN_MAX_G <ATC_TURN_MAX_G>` to slightly lower than the "
"highest values seen.  Note the value shown may be in cm/s/s so the value "
"should be divided by 981 to match the parameter"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`ATC_TURN_MAX_G <ATC_TURN_MAX_G>` 设为略低于观测到的最大值。注意显示的值可能以 cm/s/s "
"为单位，需除以 981 以匹配参数单位"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:38
#: 8dcb156050c744e8a26eee7bd79ce7d7
msgid ""
":ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>` defines the target speed (in m/s) that the "
"vehicle will drive at in :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>` and :ref:`Guided <guided-"
"mode>`.  It will also be used in :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>` and :ref:`SmartRTL "
"<smartrtl-mode>` if :ref:`RTL_SPEED <RTL_SPEED>` is set to zero"
msgstr ""
":ref:`WP_SPEED <WP_SPEED>` 定义车辆在 :ref:`Auto <auto-mode>` 和 :ref:`Guided "
"<guided-mode>` 模式下的目标速度（单位：m/s）。若 :ref:`RTL_SPEED <RTL_SPEED>` 设为零，:ref:`RTL"
" <rtl-mode>` 和 :ref:`SmartRTL <smartrtl-mode>` 模式也将使用此值"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:39
#: 2e3a3e89cae1420f881f1c6138697834
msgid ""
":ref:`WP_RADIUS <WP_RADIUS>` specifies the distance before the waypoint that"
" the vehicle may begin turning towards the next waypoint.  This parameter "
"should not be set too low or the vehicle may attempt unhelpful turns as it "
"gets very close to the waypoint."
msgstr ""
":ref:`WP_RADIUS <WP_RADIUS>` "
"指定在到达航点之前多远距离处，车辆可以开始转向下一个航点。此参数不应设得过低，否则车辆在非常接近航点时可能会进行无益的转弯。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:40
#: a490a48834be4ae1855d015b0a8a8d9d
msgid ""
"``WP_OVERSHOOT`` is used to slow the vehicle if it strays too far from the "
"line between the origin and destination.  If set too low the vehicle may "
"slow down very often as its position drfits off the line between waypoints."
"  If set too high the vehicle may not slow down for corners."
msgstr ""
"``WP_OVERSHOOT`` "
"用于在车辆偏离起点与目标点连线过远时降低速度。若设置过低，车辆可能频繁减速（因位置偏离航点间连线）；若设置过高，车辆在转弯前可能不会减速。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-navigation-420.rst:41
#: 5473092f63964328826008dab64e9eae
msgid ""
":ref:`PIVOT_TURN_ANGLE <PIVOT_TURN_ANGLE>` is only used by skid steering "
"vehicles.  If the vehicle's heading error becomes larger than this value (in"
" degrees) the vehicle will momentarily stop and pivot towards the target "
"before continuing.  See :ref:`Tuning Pivot Turns <rover-tuning-pivot-turns>`"
" for more details."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PIVOT_TURN_ANGLE <PIVOT_TURN_ANGLE>` "
"仅用于差速转向车辆。若车辆的航向误差超过此值（单位：度），车辆将暂时停下并原地旋转朝向目标，然后继续前进。详见 :ref:`调整原地转向 <rover-"
"tuning-pivot-turns>`。"
